0..83 Comment "/// This source compares a stuck call with the form required by its parameter type."
84..87 Comment "///"
88..150 Comment "/// `composedHere` has a type over the composite of two paths."
151..219 Comment "/// The `passed` declarations apply it to variables and stuck calls."
220..223 Comment "///"
224..289 Comment "/// The checker evaluates pure calls in the types that it checks."
290..352 Comment "/// The kernel replays each declaration at its evaluated form."
353..356 Comment "///"
357..432 Comment "/// - see: #4065 — the checker refused a stuck call passed to a parameter"
433..502 Comment "/// - see: #4038 — a composite by a definition over stuck endpoints"
503..555 Comment "/// - see: #720 — a call argument\'s form in a type"
